        "name": "Salon Studio (SoftN + Forms)",
        "description": "Turnkey hair salon & beauty studio manager: daily appointment book by stylist with auto-filled service pricing & conflict checks, client colour formula cards, service menu, stylist roster, and retail sales with printable receipts. Includes the full-stack SoftN application plus 5 schema-matched FormLogic forms & management charts sharing the same live SQLite database.",
